4:["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Funding"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Education Loan for Study Abroad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"While students and their guardians are always on the lookout for the best study abroad options, they are always considering costs. Many students, during their research phase, rule out good options only because of the tuition fee. This is because most of them are not aware of the number of options – such as loans and scholarships – that are out there to ease their financial burden. Free information helps create trust and adds to their credibility. Take for instance GyanDhan"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","Education Loan For Abroad Studies",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Education Loan For Abroad Studies"}],[["$","p",", which is actually an",{"children":", which is actually an"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","Education Financing Platform",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Education Financing Platform"}],[["$","p",". Even before prospective customers contact GyanDhan, they can avail of a lot of information from the website.",{"children":". Even before prospective customers contact GyanDhan, they can avail of a lot of information from the website."}],["$","p","GyanDhan is one startup that has created a positive vibe in the education market space. Unlike many other overseas education consultancies out there, GyanDhan does not charge students any money for providing them with basic information. In fact, they believe in providing the student with every bit of information possible, and only connecting the dots where needed.",{"children":"GyanDhan is one startup that has created a positive vibe in the education market space. Unlike many other overseas education consultancies out there, GyanDhan does not charge students any money for providing them with basic information. In fact, they believe in providing the student with every bit of information possible, and only connecting the dots where needed."}],["$","p","It is their tie-up with some of the world’s best universities, some of India’s top banks,",{"children":"It is their tie-up with some of the world’s best universities, some of India’s top banks,"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","Non-Banking Financial Companies (NBFCs)",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Non-Banking Financial Companies (NBFCs)"}],[["$","p",", and international players that really help students. On their own, students find it really hard to reach out to these institutions to get their work done. But going through an organized channel like GyanDhan streamlines the process and assures these institutions as well, because of GyanDhan’s market credibility and trust factor.",{"children":", and international players that really help students. On their own, students find it really hard to reach out to these institutions to get their work done. But going through an organized channel like GyanDhan streamlines the process and assures these institutions as well, because of GyanDhan’s market credibility and trust factor."}],"$L11","$L12","$L13"],"$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}],"$L19"]}]}],"$L1a"]}]
