11:["$","p","On several occasions, GyanDhan has gone out of the way to convince banks and NBFCs to grant loans to students in unusual cases. There are many problems with the",{"children":"On several occasions, GyanDhan has gone out of the way to convince banks and NBFCs to grant loans to students in unusual cases. There are many problems with the"}]
