13:["$","p","of student’s guardians. The guardian might not have a good CIBIL score at times. And then there are cases where the student or guardian might not have any collateral at all. Regardless of the complexity, GyanDhan has helped every student acquire the highest concession on their educational costs.",{"children":"of student’s guardians. The guardian might not have a good CIBIL score at times. And then there are cases where the student or guardian might not have any collateral at all. Regardless of the complexity, GyanDhan has helped every student acquire the highest concession on their educational costs."}]
