15:["$","section","Availing Education Loan",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Availing Education Loan"}],[["$","p","GyanDhan helps the student at each step of the process of availing of a loan. If students reach out to lenders themselves, the process might take 15 or more days. Applying through GyanDhan, the turnaround time reduces to half or less. The student gains an extra advantage by having a checklist of all the documents needed to take the application further.",{"children":"GyanDhan helps the student at each step of the process of availing of a loan. If students reach out to lenders themselves, the process might take 15 or more days. Applying through GyanDhan, the turnaround time reduces to half or less. The student gains an extra advantage by having a checklist of all the documents needed to take the application further."}],["$","p","The company assigns a Personalized Loan Counsellor to each customer, to avoid any lag in their loan application process. Students can also track the status of their education loans with the help of the Loan-Tracking tool available on GyanDhan’s website.",{"children":"The company assigns a Personalized Loan Counsellor to each customer, to avoid any lag in their loan application process. Students can also track the status of their education loans with the help of the Loan-Tracking tool available on GyanDhan’s website."}],["$","p","The moment students start researching colleges to study abroad, they shortlist and eliminate colleges based on the tuition fee. Taking into account other expenses, such as accommodation costs, insurance costs, living expenses, application fee, and airfare, students and their parents start getting headaches looking at the cumulative sum.",{"children":"The moment students start researching colleges to study abroad, they shortlist and eliminate colleges based on the tuition fee. Taking into account other expenses, such as accommodation costs, insurance costs, living expenses, application fee, and airfare, students and their parents start getting headaches looking at the cumulative sum."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
16:["$","section","Education Loan Options",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Education Loan Options"}],[["$","p","GyanDhan has tie-ups with some of the leading banks, including State Bank of India (SBI), Bank of Baroda, and Axis Bank. While all banks have different interest rates and policies, the best thing is the number of flexible options GyanDhan provides students with. Students with little to no collateral still have a chance to avail an unsecured loan, given the range of options provided by GyanDhan.",{"children":"GyanDhan has tie-ups with some of the leading banks, including State Bank of India (SBI), Bank of Baroda, and Axis Bank. While all banks have different interest rates and policies, the best thing is the number of flexible options GyanDhan provides students with. Students with little to no collateral still have a chance to avail an unsecured loan, given the range of options provided by GyanDhan."}],["$","p","All banks have their own advantages. With SBI, there is the option of loan insurance –",{"children":"All banks have their own advantages. With SBI, there is the option of loan insurance –"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
17:["$","section","Rinn Raksha Insurance",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Rinn Raksha Insurance"}],[["$","p",", which provides the student with an extra discount on the interest rate. For example, a student who has to pay an interest rate of 10.75 percent, has to pay an interest rate of only 10.25 percent after buying the Rinn Raksha Insurance. It is a",{"children":", which provides the student with an extra discount on the interest rate. For example, a student who has to pay an interest rate of 10.75 percent, has to pay an interest rate of only 10.25 percent after buying the Rinn Raksha Insurance. It is a"}],["$","p","one-time cost",{"children":"one-time cost"}],["$","p","that protects the student’s guardians from making any further payments, in case something unfortunate happens to the student.",{"children":"that protects the student’s guardians from making any further payments, in case something unfortunate happens to the student."}],["$","p","GyanDhan has tied up with top",{"children":"GyanDhan has tied up with top"}],["$","p","NBFCs",{"children":"NBFCs"}],["$","p","such as",{"children":"such as"}],["$","p","Credila, InCred, Avanse",{"children":"Credila, InCred, Avanse"}],["$","p",", and",{"children":", and"}],["$","p","Auxilo",{"children":"Auxilo"}],["$","p",". If students don’t have an earning co-applicant, another good alternative is international players. By connecting the student to some credible international players like",{"children":". If students don’t have an earning co-applicant, another good alternative is international players. By connecting the student to some credible international players like"}],["$","p","MPower Financing",{"children":"MPower Financing"}],["$","p",", GyanDhan does not leave any stone unturned in providing students with enough loan options to suit their requirements and situation.",{"children":", GyanDhan does not leave any stone unturned in providing students with enough loan options to suit their requirements and situation."}],["$","p","Through effective communication and regular follow-ups, GyanDhan has been able to provide students with loans in cases where it seemed far from possible. In one case, a student without collateral was granted a loan by an NBFC, including the collateral owned by the guardians of another co-applicant who had applied for the same university.",{"children":"Through effective communication and regular follow-ups, GyanDhan has been able to provide students with loans in cases where it seemed far from possible. In one case, a student without collateral was granted a loan by an NBFC, including the collateral owned by the guardians of another co-applicant who had applied for the same university."}],["$","p","Students whose Co-applicant have had bad CIBIL scores, collaterals of insufficient value, or collaterals not complying with the lender’s policies, have all been granted loans – thanks to GyanDhan’s credibility and convincing abilities.",{"children":"Students whose Co-applicant have had bad CIBIL scores, collaterals of insufficient value, or collaterals not complying with the lender’s policies, have all been granted loans – thanks to GyanDhan’s credibility and convincing abilities."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
18:["$","section","Collaboration of GyanDhan and One Window",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Collaboration of GyanDhan and One Window"}],[["$","p","GyanDhan and One Window Overseas Education have been working together for around 3 years to help study abroad aspirants throughout the university application and education financing process.",{"children":"GyanDhan and One Window Overseas Education have been working together for around 3 years to help study abroad aspirants throughout the university application and education financing process."}],["$","p","GyanDhan",{"children":"GyanDhan"}],["$","p","refers to its students, who want assistance regarding admissions in different universities abroad, to One Window. Similarly, students who connect",{"children":"refers to its students, who want assistance regarding admissions in different universities abroad, to One Window. Similarly, students who connect"}],["$","p","One Window",{"children":"One Window"}],["$","p","for university application and are looking for education loan assistance, are referred to GyanDhan for first-rate assistance. In this way, these two entities together become a one-stop solution for students to get the best help in terms of university application, scholarships, and free education loan assistance.",{"children":"for university application and are looking for education loan assistance, are referred to GyanDhan for first-rate assistance. In this way, these two entities together become a one-stop solution for students to get the best help in terms of university application, scholarships, and free education loan assistance."}],["$","p","Final Word",{"children":"Final Word"}],["$","p","At a time when startups are wrapping up their businesses, GyanDhan looks to set a benchmark and establish a foothold in the market for a longer run. This is all because of their openness. Openness in transparency levels, and the willingness to learn and keep evolving.",{"children":"At a time when startups are wrapping up their businesses, GyanDhan looks to set a benchmark and establish a foothold in the market for a longer run. This is all because of their openness. Openness in transparency levels, and the willingness to learn and keep evolving."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
